sysinfo 0.40.3: the illumos backend of sysinfo PR #1741 (https://github.com/GuillaumeGomez/sysinfo/pull/1741,
notpeter/sysinfo dfcd8a2c, MIT; its src/ hunks less one doc comment), ported to the 0.40.3 API: the Network link speed
(the link kstat's ifspeed), read_sockaddr without sa_len, no md_doc/is_supported.md. Applied by
pkgs/illumos/cli/rust-extra.nix (bottom). Drop it when a sysinfo release has an illumos backend.

